<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle steady-up $2.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle steady-up $2.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers were steady to $1.00 per cwt higher and feeder heifers were steady to $2.00 higher, compared to last week's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 62.50-70.50, including 27 head 665 lbs 70.00; 700-800 lbs 59.50-67.50; 800- 900 lbs 60.50-64.00. Holstein Large 2 500-600 lbs 53.90-56.50; 600-700 lbs 11 head 640 lbs 54.95; 700-900 lbs 48.00-52.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 59.00- 67.00; 700-800 lbs 55.00-59.50. Medium and Large 2 500-600 lbs 49.00-55.50. Cattle and Calves Receipts - 2,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
